(Finance Expense Reimbursement Policy v3.0) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 1 ? Eligible Expenses) Tj T*
(Business travel, client meals, and approved software subscriptions are reimbursable.) Tj T*
(Personal expenses are not eligible for reimbursement under any circumstances.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 2 ? Approval Thresholds) Tj T*
(Expenses under 50 GBP require manager approval only.) Tj T*
(Expenses between 50 GBP and 500 GBP require manager and Finance approval.) Tj T*
(Expenses above 500 GBP require Director-level sign-off.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 3 ? Submission Deadline) Tj T*
(Expenses must be submitted within 30 days of being incurred.) Tj T*
(Late submissions will not be reimbursed without written Director approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
