(Finance Expense Reimbursement Policy v3.0 ? Page 2) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 4 ? Meal Allowances) Tj T*
(Breakfast allowance: 15 GBP. Lunch allowance: 20 GBP. Dinner allowance: 35 GBP.) Tj T*
(Alcohol is not reimbursable as part of a meal expense.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 5 ? Travel Booking) Tj T*
(All flights must be booked through the approved travel portal.) Tj T*
(Economy class is required for flights under 4 hours.) Tj T*
(Business class requires VP-level or above pre-approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 6 ? Conflict with IT Policy) Tj T*
(Software subscriptions approved under this policy still require IT Security sign-off) Tj T*
(as described in the IT Security Policy Section 3.) Tj T*
